<li><strong>Enable the feature</strong> by setting <code>EnableNativePackageReferenceSupport</code> to <code>true</code> in your project or <code>Directory.Build.props</code>.</li>
<li><strong>Add a PackageReference</strong> to your <code>.vcxproj</code> and build.</li>
